# Generic list operations need distinct summaries for distinct SMT sorts.

```catala
declaration scope PolymorphicSummaries:
  input integers content list of integer
  input decimals content list of decimal
  output integer_positive content boolean
  output decimal_positive content boolean

scope PolymorphicSummaries:
  definition integer_positive equals
    if (minimum of integers or if list empty then 0) > 0 then true else false
  definition decimal_positive equals
    if (minimum of decimals or if list empty then 0.0) > 0.0 then true else false
```
